# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Agent tooling and agent-authored working notes — NEVER commit these.
#
# /docs        = SHIPPED documentation only (dev + user guides). Tracked.
# /agent-docs  = plans, runbooks, pickup/handoff, memory, analysis. Local only.
#
# Rationale: agent working notes carry commercial strategy, integration weak
# points and half-formed plans. They are not product documentation and must not
# ship to a client or a public mirror.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Agent working notes — the ONLY home for plans/runbooks/pickup/memory
/agent-docs/

